{
  "date_key": "2026-11-08",
  "date_cn": "2026年11月08日",
  "day_cn": "周日",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-08-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-08-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">游戏与科技 (Gaming &amp; App Culture)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Did you see the new update for <em>Shadow Quest</em>? They absolutely <strong>nerfed the rogue class into the ground</strong>. I used to <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">carry the team</span>, but now my damage is pitiful, and I can barely keep up with the enemies.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I know! I tried playing last night, and I had to <strong>rage-quit a lobby</strong> because some guy kept <strong>smurfing on us</strong>. He was obviously a top-tier player playing on a fresh account just to troll beginners. Plus, the new gear system feels entirely like <strong>a pay-to-win mechanic</strong>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Exactly. You either grind for forty hours or drop fifty bucks to skip the queue. I used to love trying to <strong>min-max my stats</strong> to get the perfect character build, but now it&#x27;s just about who spends the most cash. And honestly, the mobile port is turning out to <strong>be a battery hog</strong>. My phone died in less than two hours!</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Tell me about it. Last week, an update glitched during installation and my old tablet got <strong>bricked beyond repair</strong>. It won&#x27;t even turn on. Now I&#x27;m exclusively playing on my phone, but I&#x27;m constantly <strong>experiencing phantom vibrations</strong> because my brain thinks the game&#x27;s sending me raid notifications when it isn&#x27;t.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">That&#x27;s the danger of downloading these ecosystem-tied apps. You <strong>get caught in a walled garden</strong> where all your progress, digital assets, and purchases only exist on their specific platform, and you can&#x27;t transfer anything.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Yeah, the studio originally promised cross-platform saves years ago, but apparently that feature is <strong>stuck in development hell</strong> and will probably never see the light of day. I might just <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">cut my losses</span> and play something else.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">你看到《暗影任务》的新更新了吗？他们彻底把盗贼职业削弱到了谷底（nerfed the rogue class into the ground）。我以前总是带飞全队（carry the team），但现在我的伤害低得可怜，连打怪都快跟不上了。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">我知道！我昨晚试着玩了一下，结果不得不愤怒地退出游戏房间（rage-quit a lobby），因为有个人一直用小号虐我们（smurfing on us）。他显然是个顶尖玩家，故意建个新号来捉弄新手。另外，新的装备系统感觉完全就是一个花钱就能赢的机制（a pay-to-win mechanic）。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">没错。你要么死肝40个小时，要么花50块钱走捷径。我以前很喜欢努力把我的属性收益最大化（min-max my stats）来打造完美的角色配置，但现在只看谁花的钱多。老实说，这个手机移植版现在成了一个耗电大户（be a battery hog）。我的手机不到两小时就没电了！</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">可不是嘛。上周有个更新在安装时出了故障，我的旧平板彻底变砖，完全无法修复了（bricked beyond repair）。连机都开不了。现在我只能完全在手机上玩，但我经常经历幽灵震动（experiencing phantom vibrations），因为我的大脑总以为游戏在给我发副本通知，而实际上并没有。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">这就是下载这些绑定生态系统的应用软件的危险之处。你被困在了一个封闭的生态花园里（get caught in a walled garden），你所有的进度、数字资产和购买记录只存在于他们特定的平台上，什么也转移不走。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">是啊，工作室几年前本来承诺要推出跨平台存档功能的，但显然那个功能陷入了开发地狱（stuck in development hell），估计永远也见不到天日了。我也许干脆及时止损（cut my losses），去玩点别的游戏算了。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">nerf something into the ground</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 把（游戏中的角色、武器等）削弱到毫无用处/谷底</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (游戏圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 讨论游戏平衡性调整，特别是当某项改动过于严厉时。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">rage-quit a lobby</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 愤怒地退出游戏大厅/对局</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (游戏圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容玩家因游戏过程中的挫败感或队友太坑而情绪失控，直接强退游戏。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">smurf on someone</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 高水平玩家建低等级小号去虐菜/欺负新手</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (游戏圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述在线多人游戏中，资深玩家故意隐瞒实力在低段位比赛中大杀特杀的行为。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">a pay-to-win mechanic</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 花钱就能赢的机制</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (游戏圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 批评某些游戏不是靠实力，而是靠玩家充值购买强力道具来获取压倒性优势。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">min-max one&#x27;s stats</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 将属性收益最大化（极端追求某项数值而完全放弃另一项数值）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (游戏圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 用于角色扮演游戏（RPG）中，玩家为了达到最优化配置，精确计算并分配角色的能力点数。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">be a battery hog</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 是耗电大户</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用 (科技圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 抱怨某个应用程序或软件在后台极度消耗移动设备的电量。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">bricked beyond repair</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 彻底变砖，完全无法修复（指电子设备）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (科技圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容智能手机、平板或电脑因软件升级失败或严重硬件故障而像砖头一样毫无反应。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">experiencing phantom vibrations</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 经历幽灵震动（产生手机在震动的错觉）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (科技圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述现代人因过度依赖智能手机，而经常产生手机在口袋里震动来消息的心理错觉。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">get caught in a walled garden</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 被困在封闭的生态花园/封闭系统中</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (科技圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指被锁定在苹果、谷歌等大公司的封闭生态系统中，用户难以将其数据或购买的内容转移到其他竞争平台上。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">stuck in development hell</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 陷入开发地狱（开发停滞不前）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用 (科技与影视圈)</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容一个游戏、软件或电影项目在开发过程中遇到无数瓶颈，长期卡在某个阶段无法发布。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Curriculum localization and domain legitimacy</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Localizing Content, Presupposing English</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">curriculum localization textbook language choice domain legitimacy multilingual participation</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">这是从跨国课程公平已自然长出的次级新方向。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能区分文化代表性与语言参与权的概念、教材审计方法和比较设计。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/politics/article/3373644/chinas-fierce-race-success-mental-health-struggles-are-starting-earlier\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国激烈竞争下，年轻人心理健康问题日益提前</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">In China’s fierce race for success, mental health struggles are starting earlier</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项最新调查显示，在中国高度竞争的社会环境中，青少年面临巨大的学业和职业压力，导致心理健康问题出现的时间越来越早，引起了社会对教育体制和心理健康的广泛关注。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/08/2003867350\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“对华政策跨国议会联盟”强调台海和平优先</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan Strait peace a priority: IPAC</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">对华政策跨国议会联盟（IPAC）近日发表声明，强调维护台湾海峡的和平与稳定是其政策优先事项，呼吁国际社会关注并采取行动，以避免地区冲突升级。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwg7xp8kx4v5o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">加密货币巨头币安遭遇63亿美元黑客攻击，疑为史上最大规模</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Crypto giant Binance hit by $6.3bn hack suspected to be largest in history</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">加密货币交易所币安（Binance）近日证实遭遇了一起高达63亿美元的黑客攻击，这可能是加密货币历史上最大规模的盗窃案，凸显了数字资产安全面临的严峻挑战，引发业界震惊和用户担忧。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/10/26/xi-jinping-term-limits-open-letter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">网传中国学生呼吁恢复国家主席任期制的帖子</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Online post purportedly by Chinese students calls for restoring term limits for Xi</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一份据称由中国学生发布的网络帖子近日流传，呼吁恢复国家主席的任期限制，引发了对中国政治体制和言论自由的讨论。该帖子的真实性和影响尚待证实。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/29/chinas-investment-in-transport-infrastructure-has-peaked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国交通基础设施投资已达顶峰</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s investment in transport infrastructure has peaked</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">分析指出，中国在交通基础设施领域的投资已达到饱和点，未来增长空间有限。这预示着中国经济发展模式的转变，并可能对相关产业和地方财政产生深远影响。（经济分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/07/g-s1-152536/netanyahu-israel-government-eisenkot-herzog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">以色列总统授权反对党领导人组建政府，而非内塔尼亚胡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Israel&#x27;s president taps opposition candidate, not Netanyahu, to form a government</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">以色列总统宣布将组建政府的任务交给反对党领导人，而非现任总理内塔尼亚胡，此举可能标志着以色列政局出现重大转折，结束内塔尼亚胡长期执政的局面，引发广泛关注。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/national/2026/11/what-comes-after-midterms-washington-week/689342/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国中期选举后，政治格局将走向何方？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">What Comes After the Midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章探讨了美国中期选举尘埃落定后，未来两年美国政治可能面临的走向与挑战。这届选举结果不仅影响两党权力平衡，也可能重塑总统拜登的执政议程，对美国国内外政策产生深远影响。（政治分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/06/us-midterm-elections-senate-ages-average-decline-oecd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国参议院迎来大量年轻议员</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The U.S. Senate Just Got a Lot Younger</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本次美国中期选举后，多位年轻政治新星成功进入参议院，显著拉低了参议员的平均年龄。这一变化预示着美国最高立法机构的活力与构成将发生改变，可能为政策辩论带来新视角与思潮。（政治观察）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/07/jensen-huang-nvidia-congress-china-spy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋因涉嫌与中国间谍活动相关联而面临国会调查</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&quot;Congress will investigate&quot;: Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang faces probe over alleged Chinese spy ties</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋正面临美国国会的调查，起因是其公司涉嫌与中国间谍活动存在关联。此事件可能对英伟达的商业运营及其在美中科技竞争中的地位产生重大影响，引发广泛关注。（科技新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmd7q15drwgeo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">克拉科夫枪击案：目前已知信息汇总</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">What we know so far after Krakow gun attack</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">波兰克拉科夫市发生枪击事件后，本文汇总了截至目前警方调查和媒体披露的最新进展。该事件造成人员伤亡，引发当地社会恐慌，警方正积极调查，以查明袭击动机和相关责任人。（突发事件）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/06/anc-faces-defeat-south-african-local-elections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">南非地方选举计票已完成八成，非洲人国民大会恐遭遇惨败</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">ANC faces bruising defeat in South African local elections with 80% of ballots counted</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">南非地方选举计票工作已完成八成，初步结果显示执政党非洲人国民大会（ANC）正面临严重的失败。此次选举结果将深刻影响南非未来的政治版图和治理方向，反映民众对其执政表现的评价。（国际政治）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/ebola-why-is-there-still-no-vaccine/a-79888134?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">埃博拉病毒：为何至今仍无疫苗？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ebola: Why is there still no vaccine?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章探讨了埃博拉病毒肆虐多年，但至今未能研发出广谱有效疫苗的原因。埃博拉疫苗的研发面临病毒变异、资金投入和临床试验等诸多挑战，这对全球公共卫生安全构成了持续威胁。（医学科普）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-a-violent-fighter-and-warrior-trump-offers-press-secretary-role-to-ufc-chief-dana-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普考虑任命UFC总裁白大拿为新闻秘书</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;A violent fighter and warrior&#x27;: Trump offers press secretary role to UFC chief Dana White</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国前总统唐纳德·特朗普正在考虑任命综合格斗联盟UFC总裁白大拿（Dana White）为他的新闻秘书。白大拿以其强硬的形象和直接的言论风格著称，这一潜在任命引发了外界对其职业背景与传统政治角色差异的广泛讨论。（美国右翼）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/07/poland-footage-shows-people-taking-cover-as-a-gunman-opens-fire-in-krakow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">波兰克拉科夫发生枪击事件，民众紧急避险</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Poland: Footage shows people taking cover as a gunman opens fire in Krakow</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">波兰克拉科夫市发生一起枪击事件，现场视频显示，多名民众在枪声中迅速寻找掩护。这起事件引发了对城市安全和枪支管控的关注，当地警方已介入调查，具体伤亡情况和嫌犯信息尚待公布。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2337771/quezons-gamble-ph-sheltering-jewish-refugees-recalled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">奎松总统的“赌注”：菲律宾曾庇护犹太难民的历史再被回顾</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Quezon’s ‘Gamble’: PH sheltering Jewish refugees recalled</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章回顾了二战期间菲律宾总统曼努埃尔·奎松（Manuel Quezon）冒着巨大政治风险，向逃离纳粹迫害的犹太难民敞开大门的历史。这一行动在当时被称为奎松的“赌注”，如今在国际人道主义危机背景下，这段被遗忘的历史再次被关注。（历史回顾）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/south-asia/bollywoods-latest-ramayana-is-a-careful-spectacle-in-polarised-times\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">宝莱坞最新版《罗摩衍那》：两极分化时代下的谨慎呈现</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Bollywood’s latest Ramayana is a careful spectacle in polarised times</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">宝莱坞最新电影《罗摩衍那》在印度这个日益两极分化的社会中，以一种极其谨慎的方式呈现。该片试图在宗教敏感和现代观众期待之间取得平衡，其改编和制作策略反映了印度电影业在复杂社会背景下所面临的挑战。（印度媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/news/2026/11/07/japan/politics/japan-contribution-icc-us-sanctions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">国际刑事法院面临美国制裁之际，日本考虑提前支付会费</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Japan eyes early contribution payment to ICC as court faces U.S. sanctions</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">面对美国对其官员施加制裁的压力，日本正考虑提前向国际刑事法院（ICC）支付会费。此举被视为日本对国际法治和多边机构的支持，可能旨在强化ICC在全球司法体系中的作用，并以此间接表达对美国单边行动的立场。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-08/federal-politics-pm-scraps-sale-of-victoria-barracks-defence/107360530\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">悉尼维多利亚兵营争议性出售计划被取消</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Controversial sale of Sydney&#x27;s Victoria Barracks scrapped</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚悉尼维多利亚兵营（Victoria Barracks）的争议性出售计划已被取消。这座历史悠久的军事基地原计划被出售用于商业开发，但因其文化遗产价值和公众反对声浪，政府最终决定撤销该交易。这一决定彰显了文化遗产保护的重要性。（澳大利亚媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-he-wants-ufc-chief-dana-white-for-white-house-press-secretary/article71679478.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普称他希望UFC总裁白大拿担任白宫新闻秘书</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump says he wants UFC chief Dana White for White House press secretary</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国前总统特朗普在一次集会上表示，他希望邀请终极格斗冠军赛（UFC）总裁白大拿担任白宫新闻秘书，此言论引发了外界对其潜在政治任命的关注和讨论。（美国右翼）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/08/jones-calls-for-calm-as-nz-first-holds-on-to-12-seats/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">随着新西兰优先党保住12个议席，琼斯呼吁保持冷静</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Jones calls for calm as NZ First holds on to 12 seats</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在新西兰大选中，新西兰优先党成功保住了12个议席，党内成员肖恩·琼斯呼吁各方保持冷静。这一结果对新西兰未来政府组建及政治格局具有重要影响。（新西兰本地）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/2423118/analysis-election-night-comes-with-a-devastating-cost-for-national\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">分析：选举之夜对国家党而言代价惨重</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Analysis: Election night comes with a devastating cost for National</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有分析指出，本次选举结果对新西兰国家党造成了沉重打击，使其付出了惨痛代价。这一分析揭示了国家党在大选中面临的挑战及其对未来政治走向的深远影响。（新西兰主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/politics/361054832/live-updates-election-night-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">海伦·克拉克：本次选举的某些方面“令人不安”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Helen Clark: Aspects of this election are ‘disturbing’</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰前总理海伦·克拉克表示，本次大选的一些方面“令人不安”，她的评论引发了对选举过程和结果的广泛讨论，反映了资深政治家对当前政治生态的担忧。（新西兰中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/7/police-clash-with-protesters-as-anti-government-rallies-sweep-france?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国反政府示威席卷全国，警察与抗议者发生冲突</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Police clash with protesters as anti-government rallies sweep France</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国各地爆发大规模反政府示威，警察与抗议者之间发生冲突。这反映了法国民众对政府政策的强烈不满，并可能对法国社会稳定和政治走向产生影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq0k0lg48705o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">正在改变世界看待摩加迪沙方式的年轻索马里女性</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The young Somali woman changing how the world sees Mogadishu</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位年轻的索马里女性正通过自己的努力改变世界对摩加迪沙的刻板印象。她的故事展现了索马里积极的一面，并为重建国家形象带来了新的希望与视角。（非洲本地）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckjrwx1r2d5ro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">卫星图像显示伊朗导弹基地附近有大规模建设活动</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Major construction ongoing near Iran missile bases, satellite images suggest</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">最新卫星图像揭示，伊朗数个已知导弹基地附近正在进行大规模建筑工程，可能预示着其导弹项目或军事基础设施的扩展，引发国际社会对中东地区军力平衡和核扩散风险的关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60e0001ve9wo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">教宗方济各身体状况良好，开启拉丁美洲之行</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Pope in &#x27;pretty good health&#x27; as he starts Latin America tour</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">教宗方济各在健康状况“相当好”的状态下，正式开启了对拉丁美洲的访问。此次访问旨在加强梵蒂冈与该地区天主教徒的联系，并可能触及社会公正和贫困等议题，对当地教会和信众意义重大。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>",
  "japanese": "<article class=\"jp-lesson\">\n<div class=\"jp-eyebrow\">每日一句 · N5 · 2026-11-08</div>\n<h2>🇯🇵 今天，学会一句日语</h2><p class=\"jp-scene\">天气变凉或休息时，向朋友表达自己想喝热饮的愿望</p>\n<div class=\"jp-sentence\" lang=\"ja\"><ruby>今日<rp>（</rp><rt>きょう</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>は<ruby>温かい<rp>（</rp><rt>あたたかい</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>コーヒーを<ruby>飲み<rp>（</rp><rt>のみ</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>たいです。</div>\n<p class=\"jp-kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうはあたたかいコーヒーをのみたいです。</p>\n<p class=\"jp-translation\">今天我想喝热咖啡。</p>\n<div class=\"jp-audio\"><div class=\"jp-player\"><label for=\"jp-normal\">正常语速</label><audio id=\"jp-normal\" controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"正常语速\"><source src=\"audio/2026-11-08-japanese-normal.wav?v=5db1d57eccc7\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><label class=\"jp-loop\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-jp-loop=\"jp-normal\"> 循环跟读</label></div><div class=\"jp-player\"><label for=\"jp-slow\">慢速跟读</label><audio id=\"jp-slow\" controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"慢速跟读\"><source src=\"audio/2026-11-08-japanese-slow.wav?v=5db1d57eccc7\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><label class=\"jp-loop\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-jp-loop=\"jp-slow\"> 循环跟读</label></div></div>\n<section><h3>🧩 中文语法拆解 · <span lang=\"ja\">～たいです</span></h3>\n<p class=\"jp-structure\">【时间状语/主题】今日は（今天）+【修饰语+宾语】温かいコーヒーを（热咖啡）+【谓语】飲みたいです（想喝）。句中省略了第一人称主语「私は」。</p><p>助词「は」提示全句的时间背景兼讨论主题；助词「を」附在「コーヒー」后，表示动作直接涉及的对象。重点句型「～たいです」用于表达说话人本人的愿望，意为“想做某事”。接续规则为动词ます形去掉「ます」直接加「たいです」。本句动词变形过程：五段动词原形「飲む（のむ）」→ 连用形（ます形）「飲みます」→ 去掉「ます」取词干「飲み」→ 接「たいです」成为「飲みたいです」。句尾加「です」表示礼貌。</p></section>\n<section><h3>📖 句中词汇</h3><div class=\"jp-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>日语</th><th>假名</th><th>中文与词性</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td lang=\"ja\">今日</td><td lang=\"ja\">きょう</td><td>今天（名词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">温かい</td><td lang=\"ja\">あたたかい</td><td>温热的、温暖的（い形容词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">コーヒー</td><td lang=\"ja\">こーひー</td><td>咖啡（名词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">飲む</td><td lang=\"ja\">のむ</td><td>喝、饮用（五段动词）</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>\n<section><h3>✏️ 试着说一句</h3><p>今天我想在家里看书。（提示：在家里＝家で，看书＝本を読む）</p>\n<details><summary>查看参考答案</summary><p>今日は家で本を読みたいです。（きょうはいえでほんをよみたいです / 今天我想在家里看书。）</p></details></section>\n<p class=\"jp-note\">N5 / N4 隔日交替 · 等级为教学参考 · 每天奥克兰时间早上 8 点开始更新</p>\n</article>"
}
